            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 88362,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa menyimpan tuple dalam list seperti nilai lainnya, seperti di sini dengan tuple yang berisi pemain dan skor mereka.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[('mia', 75), ('lee', 90)]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(\"mia\", 75), (\"lee\", 90)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>List dapat memuat tuple. Isi <code>scores</code> agar memasangkan setiap pemain dengan skornya dan menampilkan <code>[('mia', 75), ('lee', 90)]</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(scores)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[&quot;mia&quot;, 75], [&quot;lee&quot;, 90]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[('mia', 75), ('lee', 90)]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(\"mia\", 75), (\"lee\", 90)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "One value",
            "id": 88363,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita menganggap setiap tuple sebagai satu nilai, jadi panjang list <code>scores</code> adalah dua.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(len(scores))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>len</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>scores</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setiap tuple dihitung sebagai satu nilai, jadi list ini berisi dua nilai. Buat kode menampilkan <code>2</code> dengan mengukur jumlah nilai dalam <code>scores</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [(\" /><text value=\"&quot;mia&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"), (\" /><text value=\"&quot;lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(len(scores))\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>len</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, <code>scores</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
